OL,3,GNEWSAMural remembers campaigner who
OL,4,Alost son to gun crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural has been created to honour the
OL,7,Flegacy of an anti-crime campaigner who
OL,8,Fwas inspired to act after her son's
OL,9,Fdeath.
OL,11,FPatsy McKie's youngest son Dorrie, 20,
OL,12,Fwas shot dead in the Hulme area of
OL,13,FManchester in 1999.
OL,15,FJust days later, she co-founded Mothers
OL,16,FAgainst Violence (MAVUK) and dedicated
OL,17,Fthe rest of her life to travelling
OL,18,Facross the world to raise awareness of
OL,19,Fher anti-crime campaign.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
