OL,3,GNEWSAMural remembers campaigner who
OL,4,Alost son to gun crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA colourful mural, created by artist
OL,7,FMarcus Lane, has been painted at the
OL,8,FMAVUK Hulme Centre following her death
OL,9,Fin January 2025 at the age of 77.
